; ========================================
; ●シーン2‐1-17
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:140_3
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_32_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:月代雪——<br>【她】，和其他人截然不同。|#0201Adv22_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她像是一个无法在这个世界上拥有归属的存在。<br>仿佛空气凝结成型一般，漂浮在人间。|#0201Adv22_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虚幻得像是一触碰就会烟消云散。|#0201Adv22_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的眼神意味深长。<br>她的身影显得无喜无悲。|#0201Adv22_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:并且——她被这个世界厌弃。|#0201Adv22_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在某种意义上，“与他人截然不同”即等同于“不正确”。<br>或许也正因如此，我才会被她所吸引。|#0201Adv22_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:400_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.8 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:一旦暴露在人群之中，她就会遭到迫害。|#0201Adv22_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以我们自然就选择了学校天台这个<br>避人耳目的地方，作为我们的秘密集合点。|#0201Adv22_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后，我对她说。|#0201Adv22_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我会保护你。|#0201Adv22_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即使我开口，<br>小雪的眼神总是望向某个遥远的地方，<br>或是投向另一个朋友。|#0201Adv22_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以我选择了托付。|#0201Adv22_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:明明已经，选择把她托付给了另一个朋友——|#0201Adv22_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay

@ResetText

@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:1
@Wait WaitMode:3

; ガラス瓶の割れる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_120 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:3
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_20_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:啊啊啊啊啊！|#0201Adv22_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呀啊啊啊啊啊！！|#0201Adv22_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呀啊，呜呀啊啊啊啊啊！！|#0201Adv22_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:怎么会这样……！|#0201Adv22_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:某种物体破碎的声音和少女们的哀嚎声响起，<br>打断了旧日时光的梦境。|#0201Adv22_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——不知昏迷了多久，<br>我的意识开始急速复苏。|#0201Adv22_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（到底，发生了什么……？）|#0201Adv22_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我一边按着疼痛的头部，<br>一边用手肘支撑着地面，但无法立即站起来。|#0201Adv22_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:醒醒，希罗。|#0201Adv22_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我虽然视野一片模糊，<br>还是在玛格的搀扶下走出了房间。|#0201Adv22_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:模糊的视线逐渐清晰起来。|#0201Adv22_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我为了再次确认房间的状况，<br>回头一看。|#0201Adv22_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter

