; ＠備考◆息を呑む

[PrintTextModified Text:——！|#0201Adv22_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我瞪大了双眼。|#0201Adv22_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在那纯白无垢的房间里，<br>一滩血泊扩散开来。|#0201Adv22_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:血泊的鲜红，<br>绘成了绚烂的蝴蝶图案。|#0201Adv22_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:以倒伏在地的白衣少女为中心。|#0201Adv22_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:白衣少女身上正被<br>无数只赤红的蝴蝶簇拥着。|#0201Adv22_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那些玷污纯白的赤色群影，<br>酿出无声的寒意，冰冷宣告着生命的终结。|#0201Adv22_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:已经断气了。<br>倒在地上的是本应该袭击了我的人——梅露露。|#0201Adv22_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

